WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Claude has made a change

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Ask Claude to walk you through it in the review

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.500
Claude opens the review, comments on lines and scrolls to them

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:16.100
c on Claude's comment replies to it

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.700
C-c C-c sends the reply, and the review stays open

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.700
Claude answers under your comment and changes the file

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:27.700
The review follows the files: the new diff, with the answer
